Modifications in this copy (jtech-dpad-apk)

This module is derived from the copy vendored in vela-dpad, which itself
modifies upstream SoftkeyBar.kt so the bar never takes D-pad focus (API 26+).

Further changes by alltechdev, 2026-09-30:
- SoftkeySlot.kt: added a label-only CENTER slot (no key profile maps to it).
- SoftkeyBar.kt: CENTER label (hidden while unbound); colors re-applied from
  Yapchik.style on every bind so style changes repaint a live bar.
- SoftkeyConfig.kt: center(...) builder.
- YapchikStyle.kt: centerTextColor.
- build.gradle: Groovy build for this project (replaces build.gradle.kts).
- SoftkeyMessage.kt (new): short messages drawn just above a shown bar, since
  a framework Toast covers the bar's labels on small screens; a plain Toast
  when no bar is shown.
- SoftkeyController.kt: shownBarHeightPx.
- SoftkeyProfileChooser.kt: the "Saved custom layout" message uses
  SoftkeyMessage instead of a Toast.
